form, landscape and site design, unlike the rural agriculture and rural residential character of the
existing neighborhood.
However, onecan state that the Laramie County Community College is a catalyst for the type of
mixed-use development recommended by Plan Cheyenne and proposed in the Sweetgrass PU D.
